-<!--  21-Mar-2000, LH=" fix wrong 1st coordinate in tspan03" Serial#4       -->
-<!--  24-Apr-2000, LH=" patch bugs for correct png" Serial#5                -->
-<!--  03-Aug-2000, LH=" update DOCTYPE for CR DTD, 20000802" ser# .         -->
